lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Yamhill County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 40 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 33% of normal in June to July and 38% in July to August. July to August is the driest pair at 1.17 inches of normal, and November to December is the wettest at 15.41 inches. Grid 30027 had its driest year in 2013 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
